1
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:52,360
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,080
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:55,920
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,920
=Episode 10=

5
00:01:15,719 --> 00:01:16,599
Call everyone over.

6
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,159
Boss.

7
00:01:18,159 --> 00:01:19,347
While we weren't watching,

8
00:01:19,348 --> 00:01:20,239
they all slipped away.

9
00:01:20,239 --> 00:01:21,120
It's just the three of us now.

10
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,439
The moment I got in trouble,

11
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:24,920
they all left?

12
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:27,519
And...

13
00:01:27,519 --> 00:01:28,359
there's one more thing.

14
00:01:28,719 --> 00:01:29,760
People are saying that

15
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:31,680
you cut a deal with the police
to save yourself

16
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:32,959
and sold out Suowen and Natuo.

17
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:35,640
You think I don't know?

18
00:01:39,239 --> 00:01:39,719
Was it you?

19
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:42,879
I get it.

20
00:01:43,879 --> 00:01:45,280
Was it you two?

21
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:46,239
Tell me!

22
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,480
Tell me!

23
00:01:51,719 --> 00:01:52,200
Tujiu!

24
00:01:52,719 --> 00:01:53,159
Tujiu!

25
00:01:53,319 --> 00:01:54,200
I want Tujiu here!

26
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:55,519
Boss.

27
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,200
Tujiu's already gone.

28
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:08,280
Boss Suowen.

29
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,479
Fine.

30
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,120
And Natuo. Natuo!

31
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:26,400
Mr. Natuo, it's me.

32
00:02:27,199 --> 00:02:28,120
(You've got some nerve, Dashan.)

33
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,560
(You still dare call me?)

34
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:32,840
(You turned us in
to get credit with the police?)

35
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:33,879
(Just you wait.)

36
00:02:45,479 --> 00:02:45,919
Boss.

37
00:02:46,439 --> 00:02:47,159
It must be the police.

38
00:02:48,319 --> 00:02:49,280
This is the hotel's internal line.

39
00:02:53,719 --> 00:02:55,039
Hello, Boss Suowen.

40
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:56,719
(Sorry to disappoint you.)

41
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:00,439
Mian?

42
00:03:01,719 --> 00:03:02,583
Wanted posters for you

43
00:03:02,584 --> 00:03:03,879
are all over Langia now.

44
00:03:04,639 --> 00:03:05,960
There's no way out.

45
00:03:07,319 --> 00:03:08,520
And Suowen and Natuo

46
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,879
are scrambling to cut ties with you.

47
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,840
But I might take you in.

48
00:03:15,319 --> 00:03:16,120
Since when are you so generous?

49
00:03:16,919 --> 00:03:18,080
I don't do this for free.

50
00:03:19,039 --> 00:03:19,919
Hand over all your assets,

51
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,479
and I'll keep you alive.

52
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:27,700
Unless you think

53
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:29,039
your life isn't worth much.

54
00:03:34,319 --> 00:03:34,680
Fine.

55
00:03:36,319 --> 00:03:37,120
Wait for me at my fight club.

56
00:03:39,039 --> 00:03:39,520
No problem.

57
00:03:53,719 --> 00:03:54,759
You really came alone.

58
00:03:55,319 --> 00:03:55,719
Impressive.

59
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:56,759
Hey.

60
00:03:57,599 --> 00:03:58,319
But it seems

61
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:01,199
you don't take me seriously.

62
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,400
Can't you hear me?

63
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:06,840
Are you deaf?

64
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,840
Dashan.

65
00:04:12,039 --> 00:04:13,719
Can't you see where you stand?

66
00:04:14,319 --> 00:04:16,000
You should be begging me now.

67
00:04:16,879 --> 00:04:17,399
Right now...

68
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:19,560
I'm begging you.

69
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,120
I'm begging you to drop dead.

70
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,256
Looks like you're the one

71
00:04:26,257 --> 00:04:26,839
who doesn't know what's going on.

72
00:04:29,839 --> 00:04:30,399
Take him out!

73
00:04:31,439 --> 00:04:32,360
You dare?

74
00:04:35,319 --> 00:04:36,000
Why wouldn't we?

75
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:37,750
Your families

76
00:04:37,750 --> 00:04:39,040
are waiting for you at home.

77
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:41,959
Die with Dashan,

78
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,759
or go home alive.

79
00:04:44,639 --> 00:04:45,120
Your choice.

80
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:53,240
Get him!

81
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,480
Boss, I'm sorry.

82
00:04:58,279 --> 00:04:58,879
Trying to run?

83
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:06,920
Dashan.

84
00:05:07,959 --> 00:05:09,439
See where you stand now?

85
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:12,399
How about this?

86
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:14,839
I'll give you a way out.

87
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:16,360
Let's bet our lives.

88
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:17,319
How about it?

89
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:19,800
How?

90
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,439
We'll bet on a boxing match.

91
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:24,800
If you win,

92
00:05:25,079 --> 00:05:25,720
I'll let you go.

93
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:26,439
How about it?

94
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:26,879
Fine.

95
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:28,319
Fine.

96
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,240
Deal.

97
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:33,639
I bet on him.

98
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:35,000
The guy in black.

99
00:05:35,759 --> 00:05:36,439
I say he wins.

100
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,720
Then I bet on you.

101
00:05:40,639 --> 00:05:41,040
What?

102
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:41,720
Oh.

103
00:05:43,079 --> 00:05:43,959
I almost forgot to tell you.

104
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,120
You're the one getting in the ring.

105
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,120
Go.

106
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:48,560
Go on.

107
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:50,199
Don't disappoint me.

108
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,399
You set me up!

109
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,360
Can't take it?

110
00:05:57,439 --> 00:05:58,120
I can handle it.

111
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,079
I'll just lose to him.

112
00:06:00,519 --> 00:06:01,079
Come out.

113
00:06:06,839 --> 00:06:08,480
Come out. Get up here.

114
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:11,480
Don't worry.

115
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,000
Go.

116
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:17,920
Stand here.

117
00:06:18,319 --> 00:06:18,680
Come here.

118
00:06:19,279 --> 00:06:19,839
Hit me.

119
00:06:21,319 --> 00:06:22,160
Hit me!

120
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:26,160
I said hit me!

121
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:26,920
Hit me!

122
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,120
Boss.

123
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,160
Boss.

124
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,600
Please spare me.

125
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,319
Hit me!

126
00:06:31,319 --> 00:06:32,000
I was wrong.

127
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:32,680
Hit me!

128
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:35,199
I'm begging you!

129
00:06:35,199 --> 00:06:36,439
Dashan.

130
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:38,199
Never been this humiliated, huh?

131
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,240
Didn't you say piggies aren't people?

132
00:06:40,639 --> 00:06:42,360
Now you're begging one to hit you?

133
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,319
Hit me!

134
00:06:47,319 --> 00:06:48,319
Hit me!

135
00:06:48,319 --> 00:06:49,240
Hit me hard!

136
00:06:51,319 --> 00:06:52,199
I surrender!

137
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,720
I surrender!

138
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:55,839
I won this round, right?

139
00:06:57,639 --> 00:06:58,319
Give me one more chance.

140
00:06:58,319 --> 00:06:58,959
One more chance.

141
00:06:58,959 --> 00:06:59,240
Just one.

142
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,079
Fine.

143
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,240
I'll give you one more chance.

144
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:04,079
Fine.

145
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:06,600
I pick this one.

146
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:07,879
The guy in blue.

147
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:14,040
Then I...

148
00:07:15,439 --> 00:07:15,959
bet you lose.

149
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:17,079
Fine.

150
00:07:19,519 --> 00:07:19,920
Come here.

151
00:07:20,959 --> 00:07:21,319
Go.

152
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,120
Come on!

153
00:07:22,519 --> 00:07:23,279
You dare hit me?

154
00:07:24,079 --> 00:07:25,160
You dare hit me?

155
00:07:25,439 --> 00:07:26,040
You dare hit me...

156
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:29,519
You dare hit me!

157
00:07:30,519 --> 00:07:32,319
That's right. You idiot!

158
00:07:35,519 --> 00:07:36,120
You dare hit me!

159
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,800
That's right. You idiot!

160
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,160
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

161
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:40,480
Hit him back

162
00:07:41,319 --> 00:07:42,240
the way he hit you.

163
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:44,720
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

164
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,080
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

165
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:47,800
Mian! Mian!

166
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:48,920
I surrender!

167
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,360
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

168
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:52,120
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

169
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:52,720
Mian!

170
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,000
Mian! Mian!

171
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:54,519
I surrender!

172
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:56,600
♪My fate is mine to command♪

173
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,880
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

174
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,160
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

175
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,240
I was the one
who hijacked your shipments.

176
00:08:21,279 --> 00:08:22,399
Tujiu never betrayed you.

177
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,319
You ended up like this

178
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,839
because you brought it on yourself.

179
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,800
What you did to Sihan and me,

180
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:31,360
and to everyone you scammed,

181
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:34,399
I'll make you pay tenfold,
a hundredfold, a thousandfold.

182
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,679
You again?

183
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,600
You're the one who killed Dashan?

184
00:09:12,559 --> 00:09:13,279
I did.

185
00:09:16,039 --> 00:09:16,559
Good.

186
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:18,679
Good.

187
00:09:19,879 --> 00:09:20,480
Perfect.

188
00:09:21,559 --> 00:09:23,480
Then I'll take you out too.

189
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:24,519
All of you, get him!

190
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:26,679
Boss.

191
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:27,759
He's Mian.

192
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,159
Two months ago,

193
00:09:34,399 --> 00:09:37,399
he was just a piggy in a cage.

194
00:09:38,519 --> 00:09:39,600
Now you're scared to fight him?

195
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,879
Anyone who backs down,

196
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:45,039
your parents, wives, and kids

197
00:09:45,039 --> 00:09:46,080
will die with him.

198
00:09:48,759 --> 00:09:49,600
All of you, get him!

199
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,240
Take him out!

200
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:51,879
Go!

201
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,039
Police!

202
00:09:58,759 --> 00:09:59,480
Everybody down!

203
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,000
You again, you witch!

204
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:08,720
Boss.

205
00:10:09,159 --> 00:10:10,559
The police are here. Maybe...

206
00:10:10,559 --> 00:10:11,600
we should pull out for now.

207
00:10:13,399 --> 00:10:14,080
What are you scared of?

208
00:10:18,039 --> 00:10:19,080
She's alone.

209
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,000
If she's dead,

210
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,480
no one will know

211
00:10:22,481 --> 00:10:23,600
who did it.

212
00:10:24,039 --> 00:10:24,840
Get them!

213
00:10:42,279 --> 00:10:42,679
You...

214
00:10:43,799 --> 00:10:44,279
Mian.

215
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,240
You saved us today.

216
00:10:46,759 --> 00:10:47,919
We can't just watch you die.

217
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:49,440
Right.

218
00:10:49,879 --> 00:10:51,240
I got a second chance at life.

219
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:53,600
Even if I lose it here today,

220
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:54,639
it'd be worth it.

221
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:55,600
Right.

222
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:56,639
Let's fight them!

223
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:00,799
Let's do it!

224
00:11:01,639 --> 00:11:02,159
Boss.

225
00:11:02,159 --> 00:11:03,559
These piggies have no fear of death.

226
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,080
No need to risk our lives.

227
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,679
We came here for Dashan anyway.

228
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:13,399
Dashan's dead.

229
00:11:13,799 --> 00:11:14,799
So I'm done here.

230
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:16,000
Pull out!

231
00:11:20,519 --> 00:11:21,120
Just you wait!

232
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:45,320
We followed them all the way
to the underground fight club.

233
00:11:45,759 --> 00:11:46,787
Why didn't Boss let us

234
00:11:46,788 --> 00:11:47,559
go in and take them on?

235
00:11:47,919 --> 00:11:48,600
Bro.

236
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,320
Boss's lady went in too.

237
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,200
How can you not get it?

238
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:53,360
She cares about Boss

239
00:11:53,559 --> 00:11:54,919
and has been tailing him in secret.

240
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,399
If we went in,

241
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,159
she wouldn't have blown her cover
as a cop.

242
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:00,720
Boss took the chance

243
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:02,679
to force her identity out.

244
00:12:03,039 --> 00:12:03,840
Two birds with one stone.

245
00:12:08,399 --> 00:12:08,919
Boss!

246
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,480
Boss!

247
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:11,679
All right.

248
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:13,200
Go home, everyone.

249
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:15,840
Go home if you want.

250
00:12:16,519 --> 00:12:17,879
The rest of us will stay with Boss.

251
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:19,240
Don't stick with me.

252
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,559
You've all seen what I'm up against.

253
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,240
Sticking with me only means more danger.

254
00:12:23,639 --> 00:12:24,279
Boss.

255
00:12:24,759 --> 00:12:25,480
With you,

256
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:26,120
we have a future.

257
00:12:28,639 --> 00:12:29,720
Please take us in, Boss.

258
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:32,320
Please take us in, Boss.

259
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:32,960
On your feet!

260
00:12:46,039 --> 00:12:46,759
From now on,

261
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,360
you're all my brothers.

262
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,559
My brothers live on their feet.

263
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:51,600
Get up.

264
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:06,840
♪Dust rises along the border♪

265
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:08,160
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

266
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:09,520
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

267
00:13:09,520 --> 00:13:10,920
♪Friends yesterday, now in battle♪

268
00:13:10,920 --> 00:13:12,280
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

269
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:13,600
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

270
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:14,920
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

271
00:13:14,920 --> 00:13:16,600
♪My life is mine to bear♪

272
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:19,440
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

273
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:22,040
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

274
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:24,360
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

275
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:25,440
♪My fate is mine to command♪

276
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:26,720
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

277
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,000
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

278
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,320
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

279
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:30,600
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

280
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:31,960
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

281
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:33,280
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

282
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:34,600
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

283
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:35,880
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

284
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,240
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

285
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:38,760
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

286
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:40,160
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

287
00:13:40,400 --> 00:13:41,520
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

288
00:13:41,640 --> 00:13:44,560
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

289
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:48,240
♪With blood and sweat♪

290
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:49,640
♪I forge my glory♪

291
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:51,040
♪In this world of chaos♪

292
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:52,120
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

293
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,600
